flow v0
# uberblick-ai/ub-agents: the whole loop, from an issue to the merge.

columns main

end issue col=main tone=muted "An issue"
box preparation "states the behavior and the smallest set of acceptance criteria"
box implementation "one PR, reviewed by another model, merged by the integrator"
end merged tone=done "Squash-merged"

issue --> preparation
preparation --> implementation
implementation --> merged
